  "selection_guidance": [
    "Always filter by Scenario, Year, and Month for any financial amount query.",
    "Use 'Consol GL Group' for consolidated group totals; use 'Consol GL Company' for entity-level detail.",
    "For elimination analysis, prefer 'Consol GL Elimination Reconciliation' over entry-level cubes.",
    "Use 'Period Type' = 'Current' for monthly flow and 'YTD' for year-to-date balances.",
    "For ownership or consolidation method questions, always query 'Consol Definition Group'.",
    "When querying FX rates, always specify both Currency From, Currency To, and FX Rate Type.",
    "For budget vs forecast comparison, combine 'SLIM Budget PnL Staging' and 'SLIM Forecast PnL' on shared dimensions.",
    "Reconciliation check cubes store computed check results, not raw financials; do not aggregate their values across items.",
    "For financial statement questions, use finance_semantics to choose the matched cube and put the mapped line_item_dimension on ROWS."
  ],
